{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Void Martyrs is a grimdark <strong>survival horror roguelite</strong> about a nun in a space suit.\u00a0Inspired by games like <strong>Darkwood,  Signalis</strong>, Blasphemous and Void Bastards. Set in a future where the space race to the moon was won by the Church Space Program. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a nun that's been sent  on a cosmic crusade to repel an invading biomechanical plague. Explore abandoned ships and drifting space-cathedrals and scavenge what resources you can. You'll need to balance your faith with you will to survive. Kill and be cursed, or stay pure and find other ways to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/UnfrozenNun.gif?t=1745088968\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way to recover the relic at the heart of each of the  abandoned locations, then hold-off the plague long enough to escape back to your ship. If you die a Saint, the Universal Church will just send another to recover your blessed remains and take up the mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/VM_teaser_gif.gif?t=1745088968\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge</strong>\u00a0<strong>and fight</strong> for scraps amongst whatever lurks in the dark corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft</strong>\u00a0the tools and weapons to help you survive  amongst the silence.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/GIF_church-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745088968\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage</strong> your holiness that's impacted  by your choices, unlocking saintly or cursed items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endure</strong> powerful stigmata and become imbued with divinity. Is it enough to hold back what's coming for you? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/GIF_close_fight-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745088968\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue-<i>lite</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-crafted grimdark art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470850?t=1745088968","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470850?t=1745088968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/41b144c3cc0d2aab04185d44648136ab1c2fb4f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745088968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/41b144c3cc0d2aab04185d44648136ab1c2fb4f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745088968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Void Martyrs is a grimdark <strong>survival horror roguelite</strong> about a nun in a space suit.\u00a0Inspired by games like <strong>Darkwood,  Signalis</strong>, Blasphemous and Void Bastards. Set in a future where the space race to the moon was won by the Church Space Program. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a nun that's been sent  on a cosmic crusade to repel an invading biomechanical plague. Explore abandoned ships and drifting space-cathedrals and scavenge what resources you can. 